```text
regarding concerns with the quality and longevity of street repair projects; different methods that
have been used for street repairs, and management of and standards involving street repair
projects.  Upon inquiry, Mr. Voeller provided information on what data Strata will provide under
their contract with the City for consulting and observation of the chip seal program, which will
not include a report on the longevity of utilizing the chip seal process, and advised a video was
available to the public containing information on the chip seal process.  Mayor Orr stated, as an
alternative to viewing the video, she has requested staff prepare a written report on the
information contained in the video.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the
governing body present with the exception of Mr. Laybourn voting “no”. (#6698)
