Announcement was made of a Public Hearing to be held August 14, 2017 at 6:00 p.m. in
City Council Chambers, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming, to determine whether
compliance of annexation conditions required by Wyoming Statute §15-1-402 exists for a
portion of the S1/2SE1/4 Section 22, Township 14 North, Range 66 West of the 6th P.M.,
Laramie County, Wyoming (located north of and adjacent to Dell Range Boulevard, east of
